  "problemStatement": {
    "formal": "\\text{Any complete ordered field is isomorphic to } \\mathbb{R}",
    "plain": "The real numbers are characterized, up to isomorphism, by being a complete ordered field. Any other structure satisfying these axioms is necessarily isomorphic to ℝ. This is the categorical axiom for the real numbers, analogous to Cantor's categoricity theorem for (ℚ, <).",
